  boothLines:
  - Buenas. Furniture for a store in Odessa. Chairs, tables. Very heavy wood.
  - Twenty years I drive this road. You're new. The new ones are always slow. It's
    okay. I'm patient.
  - You have family, joven? Then you understand. Everybody is just trying to get
    home.
  lineIfApproved: God bless you, joven. Drive safe. ...I mean, I'll drive safe.
  lineIfRejected: Back, then. ...They won't like going back. Nobody does.
  lineIfImprisoned: Okay. Okay. They're not mine, you understand? I just drive.
  onlyIfApproved: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3ff4e288b37b91e41b689dd074781fca, type: 2}
  onlyIfNotApproved: {fileID: 0}
  isFamily: 0
  carriesFamily: 0
  returnVisits: []
  bribeAmount: 300
  bribeLine: Three hundred. For your abuela's medicine. Everybody has an abuela,
    no?
  newsIfApproved:
  - headline: Box Truck Found Near Van Horn; Cooling Unit Had Failed
    body: Investigators recovered nine people from the trailer. The driver has not
      been found.
    daysLater: 0
    frontPage: 1
  newsIfRejected:
  - headline: "Furniture Truck Abandoned on Ju\xE1rez Outskirts"
    body: The cargo doors were open. Footprints led off in several directions.
    daysLater: 0
    frontPage: 1
  newsIfImprisoned:
  - headline: Nine Taken Into Custody From Furniture Truck
    body: Officials said most will be returned within the week. None of them would
      give a name.
    daysLater: 0
    frontPage: 1
